# Client structure

The client has no `.env` and no `.env.example`. Put public settings in a config file. Anything shipped in the client is visible to the user, so secrets stay on the server.

Use atomic design when a screen is built from reusable pieces: atoms, molecules, organisms, templates, and screens. Leave a one-off layout whole when splitting it would add empty layers.
